          <p eId="para_157">Before I put the question, I welcome the group from St. Pius X Girls National School student council. They are visiting the Seanad today as guests of Deputy John Lahart. They are most welcome. Deputy Lahart may have made them aware that there is no homework for the rest of the week for students who come to the Seanad, so there is no homework tomorrow for the student council.</p>
